{
  "//": "THE HOUSE'S COURT (docs/COURT.md; the owner, 2026-11-22). Scenes for the small positions of a house's own court: tutor, wet nurse, physician, captain of the guard, duel master, shipwright, master of ceremonies. Each reads a world flag the court raises (court_physician_cured, court_guard_held, court_nurse_at_the_cradle, court_retainer_grown_old, court_duel_masters_pupil, court_feast_well_ordered, court_retainer_left) and clears it. Those of the court are of the commons and are not persons a scene can name; one of the family touched by it carries a char flag (physician_cured, guard_held_for, duel_masters_pupil). The counter court_goodwill is read at the year's end: the household sees how one of its own was treated. What the scenes cost is in single credits (resource 'coin', docs/MONEY.md), as the wages are: only the feast is a house's expense and is in the books' hundreds.",
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "the_physicians_cure",
      "scene": "family",
      "tier": "situation",
      "weight": 26,
      "repeatable": true,
      "roles": [
        {
          "name": "patient",
          "when": [
            {
              "type": "charFlag",
              "role": "patient",
              "flag": "physician_cured",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "when": [
        {
          "type": "worldFlag",
          "flag": "court_physician_cured",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "thank_the_physician",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "setWorldFlag",
              "flag": "court_physician_cured",
              "value": false
            },
            {
              "type": "adjustResource",
              "resource": "coin",
              "delta": -5
            },
            {
              "type": "adjustCounter",
              "key": "court_goodwill",
              "delta": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "adjustRelationship",
              "from": "patient",
              "to": "self",
              "delta": 4
            },
            {
              "type": "log",
              "text": "{self.name} had the physician up to the high table and thanked them before the household. A purse went with it. The household noticed both."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "take_it_as_owed",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "setWorldFlag",
              "flag": "court_physician_cured",
              "value": false
            },
            {
              "type": "log",
              "text": "{self.name} said that {patient.name} looked better, and went back to the day's papers. It is what a physician is kept for."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "open_the_dispensary",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "setWorldFlag",
              "flag": "court_physician_cured",
              "value": false
            },
            {
              "type": "adjustResource",
              "resource": "coin",
              "delta": -40
            },
            {
              "type": "adjustCounter",
              "key": "estate_offset:commons",
              "delta": 4
            },
            {
              "type": "adjustCounter",
              "key": "court_goodwill",
              "delta": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "log",
              "text": "{self.name} had the house's physician see whoever came to the gate for a month, at the house's cost. {patient.name} had been lucky. It seemed fair to spread it."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
